<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banca del Gottardo Lugano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    SWISS     EOS	   20.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
